      },
      "source": [
        "## 1. TL;DR\n",
        "This notebook explores apartment asking prices in Montenegro. I clean the online listings, check the quality of the data, and study how prices relate to size and location. The exact results will be shown after running the notebook.\n"
      ],
      "id": "DaG7Inhj8Q5-"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "ebsx9-RN8Q5-"
      },
      "source": [
        "## 2. Introduction & motivation\n",
        "My project, Valora AI, aims to estimate apartment asking prices in Montenegro. I want to understand which property characteristics may be useful for a machine learning model. This analysis focuses on apartments and is not a study of confirmed sale prices.\n"
      ],
      "id": "ebsx9-RN8Q5-"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "CN5cLwfe8Q5_"
      },
      "source": [
        "## 3. Data provenance\n",
        "The input is `VALORA_AI_FINAL_COLAB.csv`, compiled from online property listings, professional appraisals, and synthetic records. For this apartment EDA, I use **non-synthetic online apartment listings only**. The source file does not by itself establish the collection dates, publication rights, or permission to redistribute the data; these should be documented separately before publishing the dataset. The raw CSV remains unchanged.\n"
      ],
      "id": "CN5cLwfe8Q5_"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "jSlLXYH08Q5_"
      },
      "source": [
        "## 4. Data dictionary\n",
        "The main fields are:\n",
        "\n",
        "| Column | Meaning | Units / values |\n",
        "|---|---|---|\n",
        "| `price_eur` | Advertised asking price | EUR |\n",
        "| `area_m2` | Apartment area | m² |\n",
        "| `bedrooms` | Number of bedrooms | count |\n",
        "| `city` | City or municipality | text |\n",
        "| `location` | More detailed location | text |\n",
        "| `property_type` | Type of property | text |\n",
        "| `data_source` | Origin of the record | category |\n",
        "| `is_synthetic` | Whether the record is generated | Boolean |\n",
        "| `listing_id`, `source` | Listing identifiers | text |\n",
        "| `price_per_m2` | Asking price divided by area (created during cleaning) | EUR/m² |\n"
      ],
      "id": "jSlLXYH08Q5_"
    },
